WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.660
Hey guys,&nbsp;

00:00:00.660 --> 00:00:03.720
I want to share with you something&nbsp;
amazing that I've been reading.&nbsp;

00:00:03.720 --> 00:00:07.080
A book -
And it is called The World Needs a Father.&nbsp;

00:00:07.080 --> 00:00:10.380
There you go -
By Cassie Carstens.&nbsp;

00:00:10.380 --> 00:00:15.000
Helping fathers bring heaven home.
I think every man should read this.&nbsp;

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:17.640
Let me just read a little bit&nbsp;
of what this book is about.&nbsp;

00:00:18.540 --> 00:00:22.080
"The most fundamental flaw in&nbsp;
society is fatherlessness."&nbsp;

00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:23.100
I agree.&nbsp;

00:00:24.540 --> 00:00:29.880
"It is time to delve into the roots of this&nbsp;
problem in ourselves and in our communities."&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:36.840
"It is time to recognize the impact&nbsp;
of father wounds in our own lives."&nbsp;

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:41.580
"Some of those wounds have created&nbsp;
hell on earth, not heaven."&nbsp;

00:00:41.580 --> 00:00:45.420
There's a lot more here guys,&nbsp;
but if you can, please read it.

